      "options": {
        "content": "<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">\n      SurgeGuard \u2014 Reliability & Recovery\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 2px;\">\n      Reliability & Recovery \u2014 Fail-closed behavior, auto-pause, worker leadership, alerts\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"float: right; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35); color: #10b981; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #10b981;\"></span><span>System Operating Normally &middot; All services healthy &middot; No active incidents</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n  <a href=\"/d/surgeguard-overview?${__url_time_range}\" target=\"_self\" style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 6px; display: inline-block;\">1. Overview</a><a href=\"/d/surgeguard-queue?${__url_time_range}\" target=\"_self\" style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 6px; display: inline-block;\">2. Queue & Admission</a><a href=\"/d/surgeguard-backends?${__url_time_range}\" target=\"_self\" style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 6px; display: inline-block;\">3. Backends & Traffic</a><a href=\"/d/surgeguard-failure?${__url_time_range}\" target=\"_self\" style=\"background: #1e293b; color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid #38bdf8; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 6px; display: inline-block;\">4. Reliability & Recovery</a><a href=\"/d/surgeguard-resources?${__url_time_range}\" target=\"_self\" style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 6px; display: inline-block;\">5. Infrastructure</a><a href=\"/d/surgeguard-comparison?${__url_time_range}\" target=\"_self\" style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 6px; display: inline-block;\">6. Protected vs Unprotected</a>\n</div>",
